WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:01.293
I'm your Ghost of Christmas Present.

00:00:03.712 --> 00:00:04.713
Like "A Christmas Carol"?

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:11.094
On a bitter, cold Christmas Eve,

00:00:11.887 --> 00:00:14.389
one dark soul is selected for redemption

00:00:15.182 --> 00:00:19.436
by the Ghosts of Christmas Past,
Present, and Yet to Come.

00:00:20.312 --> 00:00:24.399
A tradition that continues
to this very night.

00:00:25.776 --> 00:00:26.735
Like "A Christmas Carol"?

00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:28.862
Yes, yes! If you would just
let me get this out, sit.

00:00:28.946 --> 00:00:30.531
So out of all the people on the planet,

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:33.408
murderers, people who do
gender reveal parties,

00:00:33.492 --> 00:00:34.952
I'm the guy you're gonna haunt.

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:36.078
You know what? Forget it.

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:42.793
I told you. The guy is a level 20
pain in the Dickens.

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:44.336
Come on, I can take this guy.

00:00:44.795 --> 00:00:46.046
I'm your Ghost of Christmas Present.

00:00:47.089 --> 00:00:50.717
La, la, la, la. I'm not watching
your dramatic re-encrapment.

00:00:50.801 --> 00:00:51.969
Hey, I'm haunting you!

00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:55.931
You can't just run away from me
when I'm haunting you. Hello?

00:00:58.392 --> 00:01:01.395
I believe he can be
a positive force for mankind.

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.897
And he's got his hands
all over everything.

00:01:03.981 --> 00:01:05.315
Yeah, I wish.

00:01:05.399 --> 00:01:07.234
-Maud, are you texting HR?
-No.

00:01:08.485 --> 00:01:09.903
People don't change.

00:01:10.863 --> 00:01:11.780
We got a runner!

00:01:13.282 --> 00:01:14.867
That's just fun to watch.

00:01:16.118 --> 00:01:19.830
I'm here to change him
to be a more positive force for humanity.

00:01:20.372 --> 00:01:21.206
Clint?

00:01:21.957 --> 00:01:22.791
Clint.

00:01:22.875 --> 00:01:23.834
Yeah.

00:01:25.335 --> 00:01:28.547
Did you Photoshop yourself
into these pictures of my Executive VP?

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:29.631
I don't think so.

00:01:30.507 --> 00:01:32.384
Oh, you want that.

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:35.137
What I want is for you to shut up
and let me do my job.

00:01:36.263 --> 00:01:39.558
Is there a Ghost of Christmas Grumpy?
Because you could do that job.

00:01:47.482 --> 00:01:49.860
This is where real change begins.

00:01:56.575 --> 00:01:58.327
Oh that's… oh, he's dead.

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:00.621
-Yeah, he's dead.
-Oh that… nope, he's fine. He's good.

00:02:00.704 --> 00:02:02.289
-He's… wow, squirrely.
-None of it's real anyway.

